    {
      "id": "epidemic-simulation",
      "title": {
        "zh-Hant": "三城市疫情分析",
        "en": "Three-City Epidemic Analysis"
      },
      "concept": {
        "zh-Hant": "逐日模擬多個族群的人數：每天嚴格依固定順序處理，用「前一天」的狀態計算今天的變化，並讓第 d − R 天的那一批人到期。",
        "en": "Simulate group sizes day by day: process each day in a fixed order, compute today's changes from yesterday's state, and let the batch from day d − R expire."
      },
      "core": {
        "zh-Hant": "讀入初始人數與比例 → 每天依序：（同步）移動 → 第 d − R 天那批人到期 → 用昨天的狀態算今天新增（無條件捨去、不超過可用人數）→ 更新狀態 → 輸出每日數字與總計",
        "en": "Read initial counts and rates → each day in order: (synchronous) movement → the batch from day d − R expires → today's new count from yesterday's state (rounded down, capped by who is available) → update state → print daily numbers and totals"
      },
